    "limits": "Only actual local KVM4 and software/RAM. Complete SysV assembly bursts plus original stored-memory/scalar oracles. Actual invoked external R4D handlers are counted only with the exact interrupted native task and own admitted image RIP; zero means unavailable. Direct kernel guards remain guard-roundtrips; no hardware external IRQ is inferred from them. Ordinary sleep vector chains and dynamic MXCSR reuse retain numerical/control coverage, not all-register proof. No reserve OOM injection, exceptions, remote/native hardware, host CPU/MSR/cache probe, TCG, forced ISA, Windows or isolated performance claim."
